    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a mood or a \"bad patch\" though. it feels more like a fundamental truth. like i've reached the end of my purpose. everything i used to create was a lie, and now that the spark is gone, there's nothing left to justify being here. it's just exhausting to keep pretending i'm still \"in there\".",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
